  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How a step's time is read",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "A Claude Code step's **wall** time is its turns (`claude_code.interaction`); its **busy** time is the sum of its leaves: the model (`claude_code.llm_request`), each tool by name (`claude_code.tool`), Bash by its command head. A subagent counts once, as its `Agent` tool. **Other** is wall less busy, so the bars add up. Permission wait is *of which* tool time. **Tests by scope** is Bash time by what its test command ran: the whole suite, one package, some files, or e2e on every page or some. Queue, check and gate are outside the session. A Codex step sends no spans: it is **unmeasured**, its session time alone below. One run's step reads Tempo, 7 days back at most; a step across runs reads the span metrics in Prometheus."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "One run's step",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Where its time went",
      "description": "The run's step over the range: the model, each tool, Bash by its command head, and Other, its turns less these. From Tempo's TraceQL metrics: the leaves are its turns' own children, so a subagent's spans, under its Agent tool, are left out.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 17
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"claude-code\" && span.run=\"$run\" && span.task=~\"$session\" && span.factory=~\"$factory\" && span.workflow=~\"$workflow\" && span.step=~\"$step\" && span.agent=~\"$agent\" && name=\"claude_code.interaction\"} > {name=\"claude_code.llm_request\"} | sum_over_time(span:duration) by (name)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"claude-code\" && span.run=\"$run\" && span.task=~\"$session\" && span.factory=~\"$factory\" && span.workflow=~\"$workflow\" && span.step=~\"$step\" && span.agent=~\"$agent\" && name=\"claude_code.interaction\"} > {name=\"claude_code.tool\" && span.tool_name!=\"Bash\"} | sum_over_time(span:duration) by (span.tool_name)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"claude-code\" && span.run=\"$run\" && span.task=~\"$session\" && span.factory=~\"$factory\" && span.workflow=~\"$workflow\" && span.step=~\"$step\" && span.agent=~\"$agent\" && name=\"claude_code.interaction\"} > {name=\"claude_code.tool\" && span.tool_name=\"Bash\"} | sum_over_time(span:duration) by (span.command_head, span.tool_name)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "W",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"claude-code\" && span.run=\"$run\" && span.task=~\"$session\" && span.factory=~\"$factory\" && span.workflow=~\"$workflow\" && span.step=~\"$step\" && span.agent=~\"$agent\" && name=\"claude_code.interaction\"} | sum_over_time(span:duration)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "refId": "L",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{resource.service.name=\"claude-code\" && span.run=\"$run\" && span.task=~\"$session\" && span.factory=~\"$factory\" && span.workflow=~\"$workflow\" && span.step=~\"$step\" && span.agent=~\"$agent\" && name=\"claude_code.interaction\"} > {name=~\"claude_code.llm_request|claude_code.tool\"} | sum_over_time(span:duration)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "refId": "WN",
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "W",
          "reducer": "last",
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "refId": "LN",
          "type": "reduce",
          "expression": "L",
          "reducer": "last",
          "hide": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "__expr__",
            "uid": "__expr__"
          },
          "refId": "O",
          "type": "math",
          "expression": "($WN - $LN) * (($WN - $LN) > 0)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "continuous-BlPu"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "valueMode": "color",
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "sizing": "manual",
        "minVizHeight": 22,
        "maxVizHeight": 22,
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 12,
          "valueSize": 13
        },
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^claude_code\\.llm_request$",
            "renamePattern": "model"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^\\{span\\.command_head=\"(.*)\", span\\.tool_name=\"Bash\"\\}$",
            "renamePattern": "Bash: $1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^Bash$",
            "renamePattern": "Bash: (no command)"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "renameByRegex",
          "options": {
            "regex": "^O( .*)?$",
            "renamePattern": "Other"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
